07:28.800 --> 07:30.520
So we have here a lot of changes.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.320
Let's check what ChatGPT did.

07:32.320 --> 07:35.880
So first it replaced the lower the query it says us.

07:35.920 --> 07:41.520
It's not really good to use functions in the Where clause so that the index can work.

07:41.520 --> 07:46.400
So it replaced the lower with the order status without the function the next one.

07:46.400 --> 07:49.040
