08:30.610 --> 08:31.090
One.

08:31.090 --> 08:36.090
We can use a prompt in order to optimize and understand the execution plan.

08:36.130 --> 08:39.090
So now the execution plans usually are advanced.

08:39.090 --> 08:44.690
So you need a lot of know how and experience in order to understand and read the execution plan.

08:44.730 --> 08:49.730
And if you have a big query, it can be really nightmare in order to understand the flow and where is

08:49.730 --> 08:50.770
exactly the issue.

08:50.770 --> 08:51.930
But now we are not alone.

08:51.930 --> 08:56.650
We have assistant the AI in order to help us understanding this complex stuff.

08:56.650 --> 09:01.630
