09:05.790 --> 09:10.230
And now we give the following task to say describe the execution plan step by step.

09:10.270 --> 09:15.990
After that, I'm going to tell SQL to identify the performance bottlenecks and where is exactly the

09:15.990 --> 09:16.270
issue.

09:16.310 --> 09:18.230
What makes my query slow?

09:18.270 --> 09:23.790
This is of course the hardest part of reading an execution plan, and once it identifies the performance

09:23.790 --> 09:29.550
issues, I'm going to ask it to suggest ways to improve the performance and optimize the execution plan.

09:29.590 --> 09:34.950
So first understand the execution plan, identify the issues and how to optimize it.

09:34.990 --> 09:39.950
Okay, so now after uploading the photo and asking the AI, we have the following results.

09:39.990 --> 09:44.070
So now we can see a detailed explanation about the execution plan.

09:44.070 --> 09:45.350
And there is a lot of details.

09:45.350 --> 09:46.430
