11:54.730 --> 11:57.220
And of course we have to give in the prompt as well.

11:57.260 --> 11:58.500
Our SQL query.

11:58.500 --> 11:58.860
All right.

11:58.860 --> 12:00.380
So now I have the following query.

12:00.380 --> 12:03.260
