12:17.620 --> 12:22.980
When you are using groupby, every column in the select must be used in the groupby as well.

12:23.020 --> 12:26.660
And it says in your query you are selecting few columns which is.

12:26.660 --> 12:32.900
This one is valid that other two as well valid, but we have one inside the rank function.

12:32.900 --> 12:34.260
It is invalid.

12:34.300 --> 12:34.540
Okay.

12:34.580 --> 12:37.540
So now we can see here more details about the root cause.

12:37.580 --> 12:42.820
