12:43.660 --> 12:49.220
So here it's indicate clearly that the sales inside the rank function is the issue.

12:49.220 --> 12:50.940
So let's see the fix over here.

12:50.940 --> 12:55.910
So since we don't have here sales at all you cannot have here fear sales in the partition.

12:56.030 --> 12:58.470
That's why the fix here is to use the.

12:58.510 --> 12:59.310
Sum of sales.

12:59.310 --> 13:01.230
Because we have it in the selects.

13:01.230 --> 13:04.470
And here you have as well a nice explanation about the fix.

13:04.470 --> 13:07.910
So you can see here we have an explanation about the error message.

13:08.030 --> 13:14.310
The root cause it is pointing exactly where is the issue suggesting a fix and explaining the fix.

13:14.310 --> 13:18.390
